      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PC 02.253  MIX and MATCH</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">Robert H. Long 4/7/18</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Assigned to the Public Domain</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="284">Angles for R.I. = 1.540</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="302">79 facets + 20 girdles</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="320">2-fold, mirror-image symmetry; 96 index</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="338">L/W = 1.998  T/W = 1.270  U/W = 0.531</tspan>
